following addressing structure which can be found in  the  header
struct    sockaddr_vm    {            uint8_t            svm_len;
        sa_family_t     svm_family;
        uint16_t        svm_reserved1;
        uint32_t        svm_port;
        uint32_t        svm_cid; }; Addresses consist  of  a  cid
and  a  port.   The field contains the total length of the struc‐
ture, while the field contains the value The  field  is  reserved
and should be set to zero.  Sockets may be created with the local
